- Denne-ne-ne!

22
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.866
That's so nice of you. Thanks, Goodra!

23
00:01:09.933 --> 00:01:11.300
Goodra, Goodra.

24
00:01:11.366 --> 00:01:14.800
- You're all friends.
- Which means it's time to make up!

25
00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.433
Bellsprout, Bellsprout, bell.

26
00:01:20.833 --> 00:01:23.266
- What's up, Bellsprout?
- Bell, Bellsprout.

27
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:25.566
Are you referring to that Goodra?

28
00:01:25.633 --> 00:01:27.666
Oh!

29
00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.933
Oh, my.

30
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

31
00:01:33.866 --> 00:01:35.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

32
00:01:35.633 --> 00:01:39.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

33
00:01:39.066 --> 00:01:40.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

34
00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:44.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

35
00:01:44.366 --> 00:01:47.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

36
00:01:47.633 --> 00:01:51.000
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

37
00:01:51.066 --> 00:01:54.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

38
00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:59.666
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

39
00:01:59.733 --> 00:02:02.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

40
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:07.033
Defending the Homeland!

41
00:02:11.066 --> 00:02:14.466
OK. Now that we're all done eating, let's get going!

42
00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:15.500
Pika!

43
00:02:15.566 --> 00:02:17.666
Bell, bell, bell, bell, bell!

44
00:02:17.733 --> 00:02:20.366
Bell, bell, bell, bell, bell, bell, Bellsprout. Bellsprout.

45
00:02:20.433 --> 00:02:23.100
- Bell...
- Goo? Goodra, dra, dra.

46
00:02:23.166 --> 00:02:24.200
- Huh?
- Pi?

47
00:02:24.266 --> 00:02:26.666
- Sprout, Bellsprout, sprout.
- Goodra, Goodra.

48
00:02:26.733 --> 00:02:29.200
Bellsprout, bell! Oh!

49
00:02:29.266 --> 00:02:30.800
Well, so it is you!

50
00:02:30.866 --> 00:02:33.000
- It's been such a long time, Goomy!
- Goodra!

51
00:02:33.066 --> 00:02:35.866
So... Sorry. Of course I can see you're Goodra now.

52
00:02:35.933 --> 00:02:36.800
- Excuse me?
- Huh!

53
00:02:36.866 --> 00:02:39.533
It sure looks like you and Goodra know each other.

54
00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.766
Huh? Who are you?

55
00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:43.800
Oh, yeah, my name's Ash.

56
00:02:43.866 --> 00:02:46.733
- This is my partner, Pikachu.
- Pika, Pikachu!

57
00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.100
I'm Serena. It's nice to meet you.

58
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:50.800
Hi, there! Bonnie's my name.

59
00:02:50.866 --> 00:02:53.166
- And this is Dedenne.
- Denne-ne!

60
00:02:53.233 --> 00:02:55.266
I'd like you to meet my big brother.

61
00:02:55.333 --> 00:02:57.533
My name's Clemont. It's a pleasure to meet you.

62
00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:59.466
Keanan's my name.

63
00:02:59.533 --> 00:03:03.566
This Goomy, I mean this Goodra, used to make its home in the wetlands

64
00:03:03.633 --> 00:03:06.133
