- Pika! Pikachu!

68
00:03:13.966 --> 00:03:17.033
Hey, Ash? Why don't we go and see where Goodra used to live?

69
00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.900
That sounds good. Whadda you say, Goodra?

70
00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:22.166
Huh? Goo...

71
00:03:22.233 --> 00:03:23.100
- Huh?
- Pika.

72
00:03:23.166 --> 00:03:24.733
Hm.

73
00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:28.233
Bell, bell, Bellsprout. Bell, bell, Bellsprout.

74
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:31.333
Bell, bell, bell, Bellsprout.

75
00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.333
Dra.

76
00:03:39.266 --> 00:03:43.700
I see. So Goodra's with you these days, eh, Ash?

77
00:03:43.766 --> 00:03:46.433
I'm glad to see you've met some good people.

78
00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.600
Goodra!

79
00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:50.700
All right, so how does your old home look?

80
00:03:58.266 --> 00:04:01.766
I still don't get why Goomy fell from that flock of Swanna back then.

81
