89
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.600
Amazing!

90
00:04:28.666 --> 00:04:31.933
Goomy was living here happily with all of its friends.

91
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.900
But suddenly a terrible feud broke out over that spring.

92
00:04:35.966 --> 00:04:37.800
