102
00:05:30.533 --> 00:05:33.566
Goo! Goomy! Goo! Goomy! Goo!

103
00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:35.966
-Goomy!

104
00:05:36.033 --> 00:05:38.133
- Wooper!
- My!

105
00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.366
- My!
- Wooper!

106
00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:51.033
Flor...

107
00:05:53.666 --> 00:05:55.333
- ..ges!
- Goomy!

108
00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.566
