109
00:06:08.633 --> 00:06:10.533
-Terrible.

110
00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.566
Poor Goodra.

111
00:06:11.633 --> 00:06:13.266
Pikachu.

112
00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:14.900
Dra, goo.

113
00:06:14.966 --> 00:06:17.433
