136
00:07:35.833 --> 00:07:38.833
Goodra!

137
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.933
Goo...

138
00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.566
Woo...

139
00:07:51.633 --> 00:07:53.233
Wooper.

140
00:07:55.533 --> 00:07:57.866
Wooper.

141
00:07:57.933 --> 00:08:01.400
