- Pika.

218
00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.866
Goo.

219
00:12:50.933 --> 00:12:52.466
Dra! Goo!

220
00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.066
Bee, bee!

221
00:12:58.233 --> 00:13:00.300
Gul!

222
00:13:00.366 --> 00:13:04.433
Goodra!

223
