- Pika, pika!

251
00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.300
Goodra, goo!

252
00:14:40.366 --> 00:14:41.666
Goo.

253
00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:45.133
Heh. Ges!

254
00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.733
