- Be careful, Goodra!

255
00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.400
Goodra!

256
00:14:50.466 --> 00:14:52.933
- Yeah , way to go, Goodra!
- Pika, pika!

257
00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:55.833
Goodra!

258
00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:58.966
