- That was Grassy Terrain.

261
00:15:03.866 --> 00:15:06.266
- What's Grassy Terrain?
- A move.

262
00:15:06.333 --> 00:15:09.766
It increases the power of Grass-type moves!

263
00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:19.133
Flor... ges!

264
00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.566
That's Solar Beam!

265
00:15:27.433 --> 00:15:29.366
Goodra. Goodra, dra, goo.

266
00:15:31.433 --> 00:15:32.433
Goodra!

267
00:15:35.333 --> 00:15:38.166
- Goo...
- Wooper!

268
00:15:38.233 --> 00:15:42.266
Flor...

269
00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:47.433
- ..ges!
- Goo!

270
00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.933
- Wooper!
- Quag?

271
00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.366
- Goodra!
- Pika!

272
00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:55.600
Goo! Goo!

273
00:15:55.666 --> 00:15:58.500
Flor...

274
00:15:58.566 --> 00:16:01.366
Goo...

275
00:16:01.433 --> 00:16:02.800
You're still in it, Goodra.

276
00:16:05.966 --> 00:16:10.900
Talk about strong. Goodra can win this.

277
00:16:10.966 --> 00:16:14.533
- Goodra, wrap it up!
- Goo.

278
00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.866
You can still battle, can't you?

279
00:16:16.933 --> 00:16:18.900
Then show us how strong you are!

280
00:16:18.966 --> 00:16:20.200
Pika, pika!

281
00:16:21.733 --> 00:16:22.766
Goodra!

282
00:16:24.066 --> 00:16:25.766
Goo!

283
00:16:25.833 --> 00:16:27.000
- Huh?
- Is that...

284
00:16:27.066 --> 00:16:28.633
Yeah, Goodra's using Ice Beam!

285
00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.666
- Goodra learned Ice Beam! Yay! Yay! Yay!
- Denne-ne!

286
00:16:31.733 --> 00:16:34.866
Flor... ges!

287
00:16:34.933 --> 00:16:37.700
- Here we go. Do it!
- Pika!

288
00:16:37.766 --> 00:16:41.066
Dra, goo!

289
00:16:41.133 --> 00:16:42.866
Flor!

290
00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.433
Ges!

291
00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:52.133
Florges. Flor...

292
00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.633
-Goodra!

293
00:17:01.266 --> 00:17:03.633
That was great! Goodra won!

294
00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.200
- Pika!
- Yippee, yay, yay!

295
00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.900
Oh, no! Goodra, are you OK?

296
00:17:16.966 --> 00:17:19.433
- Pika, pika!
- Goo... dra.

297
00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.433
Wooper!

298
00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:23.366
- Goodra!
- Oh, where did that come from?

299
00:17:23.433 --> 00:17:26.233
- Poor Goodra. You OK?
- We've gotta do something!

300
00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:27.766
Huh? Right!

301
00:17:27.833 --> 00:17:30.233
Goodra. Quick, now return!

302
00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:32.966
Pika...

303
00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:37.400
Huh! Florges.

304
00:17:40.066 --> 00:17:41.700
OK, all done.

305
00:17:41.766 --> 00:17:45.566
I'm certain Goodra will be just fine.

306
00:17:47.266 --> 00:17:51.066
But even so, it needs lots of rest.

307
00:17:51.133 --> 00:17:52.200
Thanks very much.

308
00:17:52.266 --> 00:17:55.300
I don't think Florges will do anything for a while.

309
00:17:55.366 --> 00:17:58.200
That means a truce for the time being.

310
00:17:58.266 --> 00:18:02.066
Dedenne, keep an eye on Goodra, 'kay?

311
00:18:02.133 --> 00:18:05.200
- Denne...
- Wooper.

312
00:18:05.266 --> 00:18:06.566
Píkachu.

313
00:18:06.633 --> 00:18:10.733
Thanks for your concern. Leave the rest to us.

314
00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.566
-Lotad.

315
00:18:13.633 --> 00:18:14.900
Excuse me, Keanan?

316
00:18:14.966 --> 00:18:17.100
Are there any Pokémon around here

317
00:18:17.166 --> 00:18:19.633
who are able to use Psybeam and Shadow Ball?

318
00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.066
Huh?

319
00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:33.300
Well, all I can say is that was too close for comfort.

320
00:18:33.366 --> 00:18:37.166
If you had lost, what do you think would've happened to that little one?

321
00:18:37.233 --> 00:18:39.033
Wobba, wobba.

322
00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:44.233
It touched us that you'd step up to the plate and battle so hard

323
00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:47.200
so you could keep that little buddy of yours away from harm.

324
00:18:47.266 --> 00:18:49.266
And that's why we jumped in like we did.

325
00:18:49.333 --> 00:18:53.166
We know that Goodra like I know the back of my paw.

326
00:18:53.233 --> 00:18:54.800
The ups and the downs.

327
00:18:54.866 --> 00:18:58.500
So if we join forces, we can beat that big lug for sure.

328
00:18:58.566 --> 00:19:01.566
You want to help your little pal, don't you?

329
00:19:05.633 --> 00:19:09.833
