331
00:19:20.333 --> 00:19:22.766
Goo...

332
00:19:29.833 --> 00:19:33.766
Pi... ka...

333
00:19:33.833 --> 00:19:36.266
Ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne...

334
00:19:37.833 --> 00:19:41.266
You'd do anything for all of your friends, wouldn't you?

335
00:19:51.033 --> 00:19:52.933
So when we first met,

336
00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.966
and you wanted to get stronger,

337
00:19:55.033 --> 00:19:58.700
it was just so you could help them all out.

338
00:19:58.766 --> 00:20:02.200
Goo... Goo...

339
00:20:05.666 --> 00:20:08.166
Something's definitely not right.

340
00:20:08.233 --> 00:20:09.700
Let's look at the surveillance camera.

341
00:20:09.766 --> 00:20:12.666
OK. Maybe we can figure this out.

342
00:20:12.733 --> 00:20:15.366
Ah! Hey, it's them!

343
00:20:15.433 --> 00:20:17.233
Aaah!

344
00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.266
-Pikachu! Wooper! Dedenne!

345
00:20:20.333 --> 00:20:22.900
Give back my Pikachu! Stop!

346
00:20:22.966 --> 00:20:26.266
Now that Team Rocket is joining forces with Florges,

347
00:20:26.333 --> 00:20:28.900
what new evil scheme are they plotting?

348
00:20:28.966 --> 00:20:33.733
And what will become of Pikachu, Wooper, and Dedenne?

349
00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:47.433
The journey continues!
